{"parse":{"title":"特性/金狮争霸","pageid":7317,"revid":17473,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E9%87%91%E7%8B%AE%E4%BA%89%E9%9C%B8&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E9%87%91%E7%8B%AE%E4%BA%89%E9%9C%B8&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E9%87%91%E7%8B%AE%E4%BA%89%E9%9C%B8&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>金狮争霸</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E9.87.91.E7.8B.AE.E4.BA.89.E9.9C.B8\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"金狮争霸\"><b>金狮争霸</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">特性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"特性 金狮争霸.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/47/cl24nvm6t4bxv3t767go2rmv3xzys1i.png/80px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E9%87%91%E7%8B%AE%E4%BA%89%E9%9C%B8.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/47/cl24nvm6t4bxv3t767go2rmv3xzys1i.png/120px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E9%87%91%E7%8B%AE%E4%BA%89%E9%9C%B8.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/47/cl24nvm6t4bxv3t767go2rmv3xzys1i.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />金狮争霸\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:55%;\">\n<p>✦无视[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]地形格影响。<br />拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自然守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">自然守护</font></span></span>]时，有以下效果：<br />✦最终受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">60%</font>。<br />✦攻击受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"狩猎对象\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">狩猎对象</font></span></span>]的敌人时，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>；被受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"狩猎对象\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">狩猎对象</font></span></span>]的敌人攻击时，受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>。<br />✦免疫击退、打断。<br />✦主动攻击<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>次后，行动结束时受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"守护失效\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">守护失效</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:25%;\" rowspan=\"1\"><b>该特性属于</b><br /><div class=\"hero_box\">\n<div class=\"hero_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%87%91%E7%8B%AE%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B\" title=\"魔物图鉴库/金狮射手\"><img alt=\"金狮射手 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/03/poev90bwd6hblwljrs15ofjh2qo4nh4.png/75px-%E9%87%91%E7%8B%AE%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" srcset